{
  "name": "[IN-OUT-1] [RL_0024] Large Outbound Transaction Compared to Sum of Inbound",
  "description": "The customer's outbound transaction of {{Outbound_Delimiter}} {{Base_Currency}} exceeded the set percentage of their {{Inbound_Sum}} {{Base_Currency}} sum of inbound transactions over the last 14 days. \n\n[Applicable since the outbound transaction was at least as much as the outbound delimiter amount, and since the customer received {{Inbound_Transaction_Count_Delimiter}} inbound transactions over the same 14 days, exceeding the set inbound transaction count delimiter.]",
  "specification": {
    "value": {
      "segments": [],
